OL,3,GNEWSABridge to stay shut on hot days
OL,4,Aafter getting stuck
OL,5,
OL,6,FA major bridge allowing ships into
OL,7,FBristol will not be allowed to open on
OL,8,Fdays when temperatures reach 30C,
OL,9,Fofficials have said.
OL,11,FPlimsoll Swing Bridge regularly swings
OL,12,Fopen to allow larger boats and ships in
OL,13,Fand out of the harbour, and is used by
OL,14,Ftens of thousands of motorists every
OL,15,Fday travelling into the city centre
OL,16,Falong Brunel Way.
OL,18,FDuring a heatwave in May the route was
OL,19,Fclosed after the steel bridge structure
OL,20,Fexpanded in the heat and was unable to
OL,21,Fbe fully shut, causing huge travel
OL,22,Fdelays.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
