OL,3,GNEWSABridge to stay shut on hot days
OL,4,Aafter getting stuck
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Bristol City Council committee report
OL,7,Fsaid the opening ban aims to protect
OL,8,Fthe infrastructure, and will be in
OL,9,Fplace until an "engineering solution"
OL,10,Fcan be produced.
